sequenceDiagram
participant UI as Browser
participant API as Flask API
participant DB as Firestore
participant GCS as Cloud Storage
participant EVT as Eventarc
participant WK as Processor
UI->>API: Authenticated upload
API->>DB: Create Received record and history
API->>GCS: Write generated object
GCS->>EVT: Finalized generation
EVT->>WK: CloudEvent HTTP POST
WK->>DB: Claim attempt and enter Validating
WK->>GCS: Read generation
WK->>DB: Commit Validated then Processed
UI->>API: Poll document and history
